  "claim_boundary": "A passing T43 estimates source availability effects only for frozen Pilot-120 inputs, the frozen systems, and the frozen prompt/render/token contract. It does not establish generalisation, real-world safety, single-ambiguity performance, interpretation quality, or a reason to tune any system.",
